# Performance Requirements
Rule Type: Always

## Realtime Performance
### Latency Requirements
- Signal generation: < 100ms
- Order execution: < 500ms
- Market data processing: < 50ms
- System response: < 200ms
- Error handling: < 100ms

### Resource Usage
- Memory usage: < 1GB
- CPU usage: < 50%
- Network bandwidth: < 1MB/s
- Disk I/O: < 100MB/s
- Connection count: < 100

## Backtest Performance
### Processing Requirements
- Maximum memory usage: 1GB
- Maximum processing time: 5 minutes per symbol
- Maximum data size: 1GB per symbol
- Maximum trade count: 1000 per run
- Maximum symbol count: 100 per run

### Resource Limits
- CPU usage: < 80%
- Memory usage: < 2GB
- Disk usage: < 10GB
- Network usage: < 100MB
- File handles: < 1000

## System Performance
### Scalability
- Support multiple symbols
- Handle concurrent trades
- Process multiple strategies
- Manage multiple connections
- Scale with data volume

### Reliability
- 99.9% uptime
- < 1% error rate
- < 0.1% data loss
- < 1s recovery time
- < 0.1% order failure

